---
title: Sequence Diagram 2 – End-of-Day Order List
---
sequenceDiagram
  actor Owner as Shop Owner
  participant UI as Reports Page
  participant API as Flask API
  participant DB as SQLite DB
  Owner->>UI: click "Generate Order List"
  UI->>API: GET /api/reports/order-list?date=YYYY-MM-DD
  API->>DB: SELECT all parts JOIN vendors
  DB-->>API: parts with vendor address
  loop for each part
    API->>DB: SUM(quantity) of sales in last 28 days
    DB-->>API: units sold
    Note over API: weekly_average = units / 4<br/>threshold = ceil(weekly_average)
    opt stock < threshold
      Note over API: add (part_no, amount = threshold - stock, vendor address)
    end
  end
  API-->>UI: 200 [order items]
  UI-->>Owner: table of part no., amount, vendor address
  Owner->>UI: click Print
